# Styling

## Stack

- Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`
- shadcn/ui (`radix-nova` style) — config in `components.json`
- Design tokens in `src/styles/variables.css`
- Entry: `src/styles/index.css`

## Rules

- Use semantic tokens (`bg-page`, `text-secondary`, `border-quaternary`, `bg-brand`, `text-danger`) — not raw hex in components
- Compose classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- Icons from `lucide-react` only
- Theme: `ThemeProvider` toggles `.light`/`.dark` on `<html>`
- Prefer utility classes inline; extract repeated patterns to components, not arbitrary CSS

## shadcn

- Do not edit generated UI primitives unless fixing a bug or adding a variant
- New UI primitives: add via shadcn CLI, keep in `components/ui/`
- Use `data-slot` attributes already present on primitives for targeted styling

## Responsive

- Mobile breakpoint hook: `useIsMobile()` at 768px
- Sidebar collapses via shadcn `SidebarProvider` in `AppLayout`
